  "body": "4 Bedrooms | 2 Levels | Single Garage | Private Driveway | Elevated Views\r\n\r\nLooking for a brand-new home with more space, privacy and something a little different? This could be the one you've been waiting for!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 54 Marendellas Drive, a beautifully designed four-bedroom home that stands out from the rest. The only home in this development with its own driveway, it also offers front and rear decking, an easy-care lawn and impressive elevated views towards Sky Tower, Pigeon Mountain and Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, growing family or simply looking for a modern, low-maintenance lifestyle, this home has plenty to offer.\r\n\r\nA Clever Layout Designed for Modern Living\r\nSpread over two levels, the layout provides a practical separation between the bedrooms and main living spaces.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, you'll find three well-proportioned bedrooms, ideal for children, guests, extended family or a work-from-home setup.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is where this home really shines! The master bedroom comes with its own ensuite, while the modern kitchen and open-plan living and dining areas create a welcoming space for everyday family life. A separate guest toilet adds extra convenience.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n• Your own private driveway – the only home in the development offering this feature.\r\n• Single garage providing secure parking and additional storage options.\r\n• Four bedrooms, including an upstairs master bedroom with ensuite.\r\n• Modern kitchen with sleek cabinetry, quality appliances and stylish finishes.\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with excellent natural light.\r\n• Front and rear decking areas – perfect for morning coffee, weekend BBQs or simply relaxing outdoors.\r\n• Easy-care lawn – a fantastic space for children to play or pets to enjoy.\r\n• Impressive elevated outlooks towards Sky Tower, Pigeon Mountain and Rangitoto Island.\r\n• Contemporary bathrooms and modern finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Best of East Auckland\r\nSituated in popular Bucklands Beach, you'll enjoy convenient access to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Howick Village, local schools, cafés and supermarkets.\r\n\r\nLloyd Elsmore Park, Eastern Beach, Bucklands Beach and Half Moon Bay Marina are all within easy reach, offering fantastic opportunities for outdoor recreation, coastal walks and family outings.\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendors – Make Your Move!\r\n\r\nThe vendors are serious about selling and ready to meet the market!\r\n\r\nWith its own driveway, flexible four-bedroom layout, two outdoor decking areas and beautiful elevated views, 54 Marendellas Drive offers a combination of features that sets it apart from the other homes in the development.\r\n\r\nWhy settle for less when you can have more?\r\n\r\nCome and see the difference for yourself. Contact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit our open home.",
